<title>POLAND: Relpol 10 pct surge surprises traders.</title>
<headline>Relpol 10 pct surge surprises traders.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish electromagnetic transmitter maker Relpol SA surged 10 percent in heavy trade on Monday to 88 zlotys, but analysts could not explain the scale of the surge.</p>
<p>&quot;I can't think of any information which could have caused the surge,&quot; one trader said.</p>
<p>Some analysts said the jump might have been caused by speculative buying before the company releases its January earnings report on Monday or Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
